{"id":"wb-1-161","name":"古格王国遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"古格王国遗址","text":"古格王国遗址，位于西藏自治区阿里地区札达县象泉河南岸山上，距离札达县城约18公里。这里曾是吐蕃王室后裔所建立的古格王国的中心。17世纪中叶，这里被外来的拉达克入侵者毁坏，仅存遗址。1985年，文物工作者对该遗址进行了考察。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E6%A0%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":88431973,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88431973","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/28d6f04bad8acc3c44836b4c.jpg","title":"Guge_Ruins_in_Tibet.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guge_Ruins_in_Tibet.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/Guge_Ruins_in_Tibet.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"李麓扬，上传Zhangmoon618","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​西藏古格遗址","width":320,"height":213}}